# Build context for infra/Dockerfile.sandbox (built in-repo by `wrangler
# deploy`). The demo-agent builder stage COPYs a minimal workspace subset —
# these exclusions keep the context transfer small (node_modules alone is
# ~1GB) so every container-class build doesn't ship the dev tree.
.git
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.wrangler
.tmp
.worktrees
.claude
.vscode
.zed
.cursor
apps/docs
apps/dashboard
actions
pnpm-debug.log*
